logs\codex-20261027T1616403062430Z-0cfb95f753a8476ea7f0c37f2d141883.log:610:- **Implementation and behavior awaiting validation:** Framework implementation, negative-path tests, authorized bootstrap, PostgreSQL validation, independent security review, and deterministic autonomy implementation review remain separately gated. Documentation completion does not prove migration behavior or production readiness.
